DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261110
SUMMARY:[Control & Robotics][System Identification & Data-driven Dynamics] 
 ECC 2027 - Extended contributed paper submission deadline (cutoff time un
 announced)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: European Control Conference\nWebsite: https:/
 /ecc27.euca-ecc.org/\nSource URL: https://ecc27.euca-ecc.org/call-for-pap
 ers/\nLocation: Brussels\, Belgium\nTopics: Control & Robotics\, System I
 dentification & Data-driven Dynamics\, Nonlinear Dynamics & Chaos\nSize: 
 L\nSubmission type: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date
 : 2026-10-30\nNotes: Annual flagship of the European Control Association 
 (25th ECC\; annual since 2013)\, technically co-sponsored by IFAC and IEE
 E CSS\; accepted papers are published in IEEE Xplore. The July 13-16 wind
 ow includes the July 13 pre-conference workshops. On 2026-10-30 the CFP s
 trikes October 31 and gives November 9\, 2026 for contributed papers\, in
 vited session proposals and invited session papers\, which need an organi
 zer's session code. The PaperCept listing says no further extensions\, al
 though ECC 2026 extended twice. Industry abstracts need an industry-affil
 iated author and are not in the proceedings. Submissions opened September
  1 (day only). No hour is published\, so cutoffs use provisional end-of-d
 ay AoE. Not listed in ICORE2026 or CCF. Size L is an editorial category.\
 nOfficial deadline day\; exact cutoff hour/timezone is unannounced. Verif
 y the organizer's submission portal.
URL:https://ecc27.euca-ecc.org/call-for-papers/
END:VEVENT
